    "sections": [
      {
        "label": "1st period",
        "score": "BOS 1, MIN 0",
        "text": "Tanner Jeannot scored from low in the left circle off a Mark Kastelic touch pass 1:53 in for a 1–0 lead. Michael DiPietro, in his first NHL start since Jan. 23, 2022, kept Minnesota off the board."
      },
      {
        "label": "2nd period",
        "score": "MIN 2, BOS 1",
        "text": "Kirill Kaprizov tied it 1–1 on a power play at 6:11, one-timing a short feed from Maxim Shabanov. Quinn Hughes then put Minnesota ahead 2–1 at 12:28 with a shot through traffic on a 5-on-3; the Wild had 1:52 of two-man advantage in the period."
      },
      {
        "label": "3rd period",
        "score": "Final: MIN 4, BOS 1",
        "text": "Jared Spurgeon's wrister from the top of the right circle, off Nikita Zadorov's skate, made it 3–1 at 3:24. Boston outshot Minnesota 13–9 in the period but couldn't beat Jesper Wallstedt, and Kaprizov hit the empty net with 1:01 left."
      }
    ],
